{
  "sources": {
    "UniLab": "9e3bb6b814d694d52bfff0f074d0a2b8ede6f032",
    "unilab_rl": "441fa2bb6f58789b66dd68b87c5cac61358192ed"
  },
  "notes": [
    "sha256 values are computed over the file content at the pinned source commit (git show <commit>:<path>), i.e. the pre-removal state; both source worktrees have since deleted these files.",
    "tests/algos/test_hora_contract.py is a merge of two source files (unilab_rl and UniLab both shipped a copy); both pre-removal hashes are recorded under `sources`.",
    "Destination files live under src/sharpa_rl_unilab/ (the import package), so UniLab's src/unilab/conf/** maps to src/sharpa_rl_unilab/conf/** and scripts/* map to src/sharpa_rl_unilab/{training,tools}/.",
    "src/sharpa_rl_unilab/conf/{ppo,appo,sac}/config.yaml are derived from the UniLab config roots: only the Hydra defaults entry (task group default) and task_name were changed to SharpaInhandRotation; the rest of each file is byte-preserved.",
    "src/sharpa_rl_unilab/training/playback.py also contains HORA APPO playback helpers (create_hora_appo_playback_session, _build_hora_appo_actor, _resolve_appo_checkpoint_from_cfg, _normalize_checkpoint_value) adapted from interactive_playback.py's generic APPO factories (create_appo_playback_session, _build_appo_actor, _resolve_appo_checkpoint_from_cfg, normalize_checkpoint_value); only the verbatim HORA distill symbols are listed in `symbols`.",
    "Docs were flattened: UniLab's docs/sphinx/source/<lang>/2-user_guide/2-algorithms/7-hora.md -> docs/<lang>/7-hora.md and 8-manipulation/1-dexterous_inhand.md -> docs/<lang>/1-dexterous_inhand.md.",
    "Robot meshes (40 STL files) and grasp caches (9 .npy files) come from the unilabsim/unilab-robots and unilabsim/unilab-caches Hugging Face datasets, not from UniLab git; their provenance and sha256 are recorded in src/sharpa_rl_unilab/assets/manifest.json. Only the two git-native XML files are listed here.",
    "Files with no pre-removal source (new in this repository): src/sharpa_rl_unilab/cli.py, tests/test_package_contract.py, tests/algos/test_hora_sac_adapter.py, package __init__.py shims, assets/manifest.json, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/VALIDATION.md, README.md, README_zh.md, NOTICE.md, Makefile, pyproject.toml.",
    "Post-migration fix: src/sharpa_rl_unilab/assets/robots/sharpa_wave/scene.xml adds simple=\"false\" to the object body (its recorded sha256 is the pre-fix source hash). Without it, reset-time com/mass domain randomization breaks MuJoCo sameframe and segfaults the mujoco_uni batch runtime (mj_setConst, engine_setconst.c:1533)."
  ],
